    "title": "Traffic cops suggest road fixes, flyovers, cameras to ease west Delhi congestion | Latest News Delhi",
    "text": "Authorities identify pain points\nThe exercise has identified trouble spots across west and south-west Delhi, including key stretches connecting Uttam Nagar, Dwarka, Najafgarh, Nangloi, Peeragarhi and Rohtak Road. The concerns range from damaged roads and missing central verges to poorly managed junctions, inadequate pedestrian crossings and gaps in speed enforcement.",
